gn\u002Femployee-management",{"title":231,"path":232,"stem":233},"Player Tracker Rework","\u002Fdesign\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework","9.design\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework",{"title":235,"path":236,"stem":237},"Qualifications","\u002Fdesign\u002Fqualifications","9.design\u002Fqualifications",{"id":239,"title":175,"body":240,"description":391,"extension":392,"links":393,"meta":394,"navigation":395,"path":176,"redirect":393,"seo":396,"stem":177,"__hash__":397},"content_en\u002F3.user-guides\u002F7.settings.md",{"type":241,"value":242,"toc":383},"minimark",[243,251,254,258,298,302,305,311,315,318,321,325,328,344,350,354,360,363],[244,245,246],"p",{},[247,248],"img",{"alt":249,"src":250},"features-settings.webp","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-settings.webp",[244,252,253],{},"The screenshot also includes admin-only settings (for example limiter, laws, filestore, and app config).",[255,256,23],"h2",{"id":257},"features",[259,260,261,265,268],"ul",{},[262,263,264],"li",{},"Configure job properties such as logo, radio frequency, and Discord bot sync.",[262,266,267],{},"Configure instance-level FiveNet options through the UI (server team).",[262,269,270,271],{},"For superusers:\n",[259,272,273,280,286,292],{},[262,274,275,279],{},[276,277,278],"strong",{},"Limiter",": Define which permissions each faction can assign to roles.",[262,281,282,285],{},[276,283,284],{},"Laws",": Configure law entries for each faction.",[262,287,288,291],{},[276,289,290],{},"Filestore",": Configure file storage per faction.",[262,293,294,297],{},[276,295,296],{},"App config",": Configure options that affect the entire FiveNet instance.",[255,299,301],{"id":300},"role-management","Role Management",[244,303,304],{},"Factions can manage their own roles when this is allowed by the permission system.",[244,306,307],{},[247,308],{"alt":309,"src":310},"features-settings-roles.webp","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-settings-roles.webp",[255,312,314],{"id":313},"limiter-and-roles-explained","Limiter And Roles Explained",[244,316,317],{},"To allow role self-service safely, use the limiter to define the maximum permission set a faction can assign.\nFor example, you can allow the police faction to see colleague positions on the livemap, while preventing unauthorized factions from assigning that permission.\nIn practice, the limiter is a list of permissions and attributes available to roles within a faction.",[244,319,320],{},"Usually, the server management team defines these limits for each faction.",[255,322,324],{"id":323},"discord-bot-sync-roles-to-your-factions-discord","Discord Bot - Sync roles to your faction's Discord",[244,326,327],{},"Sync examples:",[259,329,330,333,336],{},[262,331,332],{},"Employee ranks",[262,334,335],{},"Absent\u002Fvacation status",[262,337,338,339,343],{},"Server-team groups on Discord servers connected to FiveNet (for example a ",[340,341,342],"code",{},"Project Leader"," role)",[244,345,346],{},[247,347],{"alt":348,"src":349},"Feature Settings - Job Props - Discord Bot","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-discordbot.webp",[255,351,353],{"id":352},"app-config","App Config",[244,355,356],{},[247,357],{"alt":358,"src":359},"Feature Settings - App Config","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-settings-appconfig.webp",[244,361,362],{},"App config contains options that affect the whole FiveNet instance, including:",[259,364,365,368,371,374,377,380],{},[262,366,367],{},"The default language for the app.",[262,369,370],{},"Default permissions.",[262,372,373],{},"Imprint and Privacy Policy links.",[262,375,376],{},"Livemap sync intervals.",[262,378,379],{},"Banner message with expiration time (for example to announce maintenance).",[262,381,382],{},"And more.",{"title":8,"searchDepth":384,"depth":384,"links":385},2,[386,387,388,389,390],{"id":257,"depth":384,"text":23},{"id":300,"depth":384,"text":301},{"id":313,"depth":384,"text":314},{"id":323,"depth":384,"text":324},{"id":352,"depth":384,"text":353},"Learn how to configure and manage settings in FiveNet, including job properties, roles, permissions, and app-wide configurations.","md",null,{},true,{"title":175,"description":391},"55vLMLgIY1GeHaFsgf81izPAfEv7G1PM8n8Tr8OtcYE",1795714533168,"3d638de7-68c8-4e60-9c0d-5c8dc7f2f7e2"]